s.\n\nLet's craft:\n\nVERDICT: PASS\n\nReviewed diff against requirement and old behavior. Image field added with bound Label. Fieldset legend Delivery Schedule, native radio inputs same name, immediate default checked, specific toggles datetime-local. Native radio keyboard/focus semantics preserved, labels linked; conditional mount hides datetime; no persistence required; no loading/error/empty states applicable. No regressions supported by diff. Developer risk about styling not a functional regression.\n\nNeed be careful \"default checked\" is controlled via state. Fine.\n\nFinal.","content":"VERDICT: PASS\n\nThe diff supports the required behavior: an Image field is added, followed by a “Delivery Schedule” fieldset with “Immediately” and “Specific Time” radio options, and selecting “Specific Time” conditionally renders a labeled `datetime-local` input.\n\nNo concrete regression is supported by the supplied diff:\n- Native radios share `name=\"deliverySchedule\"` and use controlled `checked`/`onChange`, preserving expected keyboard and focus behavior.\n- Labels are correctly associated with the image field, both radios, and the revealed date-time field.\n- Switching back to “Immediately” unmounts the date-time field, so cancellation/hiding works.\n- No loading/error/empty-state behavior is affected.\n- Existing form fields and submit button markup are preserved; only the client component directive and schedule state were added.","response_items":[{"id":"0b924296-b73a-40cd-985e-ecd1b56f7a8e","summary":[],"type":"reasoning","content":[{"text":"We need answer first line VERDICT: PASS or FAIL. We need review bounded. Need inspect diff for regression/unmet acceptance. We must not invent. Need assess requirement: Add an image field. Below it, add form group titled “Delivery Schedule” with radio options “Immediately” and “Specific Time”. Selecting “Specific Time” should reveal a date-time field.\n\nDiff adds image field below Message? Need context? Diff shows after exist