irement says \"Below it, add a form group titled Delivery Schedule\" Could interpret below image field. Yes.\n\nPotential issue: Existing form order maybe image below message. Requirement \"Add an image field. Below it...\" yes.\n\nPotential old behavior: Submit button type submit in a div no form. No change. Fine.\n\nNeed output VERDICT: PASS. But ensure no hidden concrete regression. Let's consider \"use client\" at top before comment. In Next app, `\"use client\"` directive must be at top of file before imports, but can comments precede? It is first statement, comment after directive. Good. If there was exported metadata? Diff only component, no metadata. Fine.\n\nCould adding state cause pre-render hydration? initial false, same server/client? With client component SSR initial state immediately; no mismatch. Fine.\n\nCould the image field have `<Input type=\"file\">` and default Input component handles value? no.\n\nDo we need verify old behavior \"preserving existing form\" - they preserved all existing fields? Diff context only shows insertion, no deletions except adding useState and use client. So yes.\n\nQuestion asks final only? Need include first line exact. Could include brief rationale after. Desired oververbosity 5. Final answer with verdict and concise evidence. Since first line must exactly `VERDICT: PASS` or FAIL. Then bullets. Must not mention tools. We have no tools. Ensure no FAIL. Maybe include no findings.\n\nLet's craft:\n\nVERDICT: PASS\n\nReviewed diff against requirement and old behavior. Image field added with bound Label. Fieldset legend Delivery Schedule, native radio inputs same name, immediate default checked, specific toggles datetime-local. Native radio keyboard/focus semantics preserved, labels linked; conditional mount hides datetime; no persistence required; no loading/error/empty states applicable. No regressions supported by diff. Developer risk about styling not a functional regression.\n\nNeed be careful \"default checked\" is 